//   CivicKarma      -> extends User.karmaScore into a full model (Phase 3)
//   RiskPrediction  -> per-ward predictive risk records (Phase 2/3)
//   IncidentCluster -> geospatial incident clustering (Phase 2/3)
// They are deliberately absent so the schema stays minimal and migration-safe.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------